{
  "_about": "持久化往返契约:每条 `steps` 依次执行后,`load` 的结果必须满足 `expect`。同一份表同时跑在 fakeBackend(tests/ipc.roundtrip-contract.test.ts)与真后端(src-tauri/tests/ipc_roundtrip_contract.rs)上 —— 任何一边不满足都意味着模拟层与真后端的**语义**(不只是参数形状)走样了。`pollMs`(可选)= load+expect 失败后按此窗口轮询重试(Op 类命令异步生效,紧读会竞态)。config 对放表尾 —— save_config 触发 ConfigWatcher 异步热重载,会重置 agent 内存态。**不含 effort 对**:它是 AgentConfig 内存态而非持久化状态,启动期 MCP bootstrap 完成时的重配置也会把它复位,与持久化语义无关(参数形状由 payloads.json 覆盖,受理语义由 ipc_agent_ops 覆盖)。`expect` 项:`path` 为点路径(可省略=整个结果);`equals` 深比较;`contains` 对字符串做子串匹配、对非字符串先 JSON 序列化再匹配。`${TMP}` 由运行方替换为本次运行的临时目录(真后端侧会真的创建它)。",
  "roundtrips": [
    {
      "name": "allowlist: save → load 归一化(trim/去重/字典序)",
      "steps": [
        [
          "reflect_save_allowlist",
          {
            "list": {
              "prefixes": [
                "ls -la",
                " git status ",
                "ls -la"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      ],
      "load": [
        "reflect_load_allowlist",
        {}
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "path": "prefixes",
          "equals": [
            "git status",
            "ls -la"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "allowlist: check 是前缀匹配",
      "steps": [
        [
          "reflect_save_allowlist",
          {
            "list": {
              "prefixes": [
                "git status"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      ],
      "load": [
        "reflect_check_allowlist",
        {
          "prefix": "git status --short"
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "equals": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "memory: add_memory → list_memory 含 key 与 value",
      "steps": [
        [
          "reflect_add_memory",
          {
            "scope": "user",
            "key": "contract-roundtrip-key",
            "value": "contract roundtrip memory value"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "load": [
        "reflect_list_memory",
        {}
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "contains": "contract-roundtrip-key"
        },
        {
          "contains": "contract roundtrip memory value"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "schedule: add_schedule → list_schedules 含 prompt",
      "steps": [
        [
          "reflect_add_schedule",
          {
            "schedule": "0 9 * * *",
            "prompt": "contract roundtrip standup",
            "name": "contract-roundtrip-cron"
          }
        ]
      ],
      "load": [
        "reflect_list_schedules",
        {}
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "contains": "contract roundtrip standup"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "mcp: upsert_mcp_server → list_mcp_servers 含 name",
      "steps": [
        [
          "reflect_upsert_mcp_server",
          {
            "name": "contract-roundtrip-mcp",
            "entry": {
              "type": "stdio",
              "command": "echo",
              "args": [
                "probe"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      ],
      "load": [
        "reflect_list_mcp_servers",
        {}
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "contains": "contract-roundtrip-mcp"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "permissions: add_permission_rule → list_permission_rules 含 tool",
      "steps": [
        [
          "reflect_add_permission_rule",
          {
            "rule": {
              "tool": "ContractRoundtrip",
              "action": "allow"
            }
          }
        ]
      ],
      "load": [
        "reflect_list_permission_rules",
        {}
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "contains": "ContractRoundtrip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "agent def: save_agent_def → get_agent_def 按名读回",
      "steps": [
        [
          "reflect_save_agent_def",
          {
            "def": {
              "name": "contract-roundtrip-agent",
